---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Shahzaib"
  description="Shahzaib is a Full-Stack AI Engineer based in Pakistan, building production AI systems end-to-end as a founding engineer across hospitality, legal, governance, and SaaS."
>
  <div class="pt-8 sm:pt-12 fade-in">
    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-6 sm:mb-8 leading-tight" style="font-family: var(--font-serif)">
      About
    </h1>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 sm:gap-8 text-[var(--color-muted)] leading-relaxed">
      <div class="fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
        <p>
          I'm Shahzaib, a Full-Stack AI Engineer based in Pakistan.
          I build production AI systems end-to-end: RAG pipelines, multi-agent workflows,
          voice AI agents, and the backend and frontend that ships them to users.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          As a founding engineer across hospitality, legal, governance, and SaaS,
          I've led teams, owned roadmaps, and shipped from zero to production.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Beyond writing code, I do product research, write technical specs, and
          translate them into sprint plans. I'm comfortable owning a product end-to-end
          or plugging into an existing team as a technical lead.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
        <h2 class="text-xl mb-3 font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]">What I'm building</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          <strong class="font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]">Simplora.ai</strong>
          : AI-powered meeting management platform that automates the complete meeting
          lifecycle with pre-meeting briefs, real-time summaries, and automatic action
          item extraction. Scaled to 300+ active users.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-2">
          <strong class="font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]">DreamDesk AI</strong>
          : Enterprise AI for hospitality with multi-channel agents handling phone calls,
          emails, web chat, WhatsApp, and Booking.com. Integrates with Mews and Guestline
          PMS for real-time reservation sync.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="fade-in fade-in-delay-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl mb-3 font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]">Background</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          I studied Computer Science at NUCES (FAST), graduating in 2024. During
          my studies I co-authored research on LLM-assisted property generation
          for Solidity smart contracts, exploring how AI can strengthen software
          verification. The work benchmarked LLM-generated test invariants against
          manually written ones, achieving 25.99% mutation score vs 31.75% manual,
          showing LLMs can meaningfully reduce human effort in testing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="fade-in fade-in-delay-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl mb-3 font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]">Stack & how I work</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          I work across the full stack and own deployment end-to-end:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-none flex flex-col gap-1 mb-3 text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)]">
          <li><strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)] font-medium">Backend:</strong> FastAPI, Node.js, gRPC, REST</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)] font-medium">Frontend:</strong> Next.js, React, TypeScript</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)] font-medium">AI / Agents:</strong> LangChain, LangGraph, LlamaIndex, RAG, Voice AI (LiveKit, VAPI), Pydantic AI, AWS Bedrock, MCP servers</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)] font-medium">Infra & DevOps:</strong> Docker, GCP, AWS EC2/S3, Nginx, GitHub Actions, Digital Ocean</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)] font-medium">Databases:</strong> PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis, Supabase, Pinecone, pgvector</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Contact -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-[var(--color-border)] pb-10 fade-in fade-in-delay-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl mb-3 font-medium">Get in touch</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-muted)] mb-6">
        Want to collaborate, discuss AI, or just say hi?
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="mailto:hello@shahzaib.ai"
          class="text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-md border border-[var(--color-ink)] text-[var(--color-ink)] hover:bg-[var(--color-ink)] hover:text-[var(--color-cream)] transition-colors font-medium"
        >
          hello@shahzaib.ai
        </a>
        <a
          href=""
          onclick="Calendly.initPopupWidget({url:'https://calendly.com/shahzaib-khan0217/30min?hide_gdpr_banner=1'});return false;"
          class="text-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-md bg-[var(--color-ink)] text-[var(--color-cream)] hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity font-medium"
        >
          book a call
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
